'@@author Rixte
@startuml
!include ../shortfall/readable.iuml

title Resetting plan state after confirmation
participant ":MishMash" as App
participant ":ResetPlanCommand" as Reset
participant ":ActiveMealPlan" as Active
App -> Reset : execute(book)
activate Reset
Reset -> Active : get()
activate Active
Active --> Reset : optional plan
deactivate Active
Reset -> Active : getGroceryList()
activate Active
Active --> Reset : optional groceries
deactivate Active
Reset -> Active : clear()
activate Active
note right of Active
  Remove plan, generation
  request, and groceries.
end note
Active --> Reset : return
deactivate Active
note right of Reset
  Verify all three are absent
  before returning success.
end note
Reset --> App : reset or no-plan feedback
deactivate Reset

@enduml
'@@author
